WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.025
Every year, on the same night, he gives the river a lantern.

2
00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:15.160
And every year the river takes it, and never answers.

3
00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:20.740
Tonight, someone answers.

4
00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:43.645
Above the harbour of Neo-Kurogane, where the river falls a thousand feet, lived the Koryu, the clan of the Twin Dragon Koi.

5
00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:50.525
Their oldest legend: a koi that climbs the Dragon Gate becomes a dragon.

6
00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:55.890
Two brothers were raised to climb it.

7
00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:07.110
MASTER TATSUO: A koi does not fight the river. It becomes the river. And then it climbs.

8
00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:19.305
HAYATE: Ha! The river likes me better!

9
00:01:19.655 --> 00:01:21.680
SEIRAN: Focus, Hayate!

10
00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:32.855
Seiran was the discipline.

11
00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:39.340
Hayate was the current.

12
00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:47.700
HAYATE: When I'm clan leader, everyone gets taiyaki. Every day.

13
00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:50.950
SEIRAN: When you're clan leader, the clan burns down.

14
00:01:53.290 --> 00:02:00.265
MASTER TATSUO: Two koi, one river. When two Koryu call the dragon together, the koi will always find each other.

15
00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:25.135
Their father died in the spring. The clan needed a head.

16
00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:36.650
ELDER: By the old law, the falls will choose. Whoever rings the Dragon Bell first leads the Koryu.

17
00:03:06.230 --> 00:03:09.555
The falls chose the younger son.

18
00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:16.745
SEIRAN: Him?

19
00:03:22.850 --> 00:03:25.100
HAYATE: Hey. We'll lead it together, brother.

20
00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:31.705
SEIRAN: Don't pity me.

21
00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:42.435
VORN: Your father owed the Syndicate a great deal. Your brother laughs at debts.

22
00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:51.450
VORN: Kneel to me, and the clan is yours. All you must do is silence him.

23
00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:58.405
Jealousy is a quiet current. It only needs one night.

24
00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:15.830
HAYATE: Syndicate ships in our harbour. You brought them here?

25
00:04:16.180 --> 00:04:19.380
SEIRAN: The clan was mine. Father trained me for it.

26
00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.925
HAYATE: Then take it from me. But not for him.

27
00:04:56.410 --> 00:04:57.685
SEIRAN: Hayate!

28
00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:05.610
By morning the Koryu knelt to the Syndicate anyway.

29
00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:14.695
The heir became Vorn's marksman. A man who belonged to no one.

30
00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:25.380
HARUTO: Dad! There's someone in the river. He's still breathing!

31
00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:34.190
DR. DAIMON: We can only save what the river left him. The rest will be sun-alloy.

32
00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:40.680
MASKED NINJA: Seiran.

33
00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:55.825
HARUTO: Welcome to the Vanguard, Hayate.

34
00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:05.160
He took a new face, and kept one promise.

35
00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:12.440
KAIEN: Your brother floats a lantern for you every year.

36
00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:15.390
MASKED NINJA: Then this year, I'll give it back to him.

37
00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:41.515
SEIRAN: Vanguard. You came a long way to die.

38
00:06:41.865 --> 00:06:43.865
MASKED NINJA: I came for the Koryu heir.

39
00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:49.130
SEIRAN: There is no Koryu. There is no heir.

40
00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:21.175
SEIRAN: Twin Koi... Torrent!

41
00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:29.015
MASKED NINJA: Dragon Gate... Blade!

42
00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:47.475
But two koi of the same river do not fight. They find each other.

43
00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:56.315
SEIRAN: Impossible. Only Koryu blood can call the dragon. Who are you?

44
00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:11.245
HAYATE: You still pull your bow to the left, brother.

45
00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:18.855
SEIRAN: Hayate. I killed you.

46
00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:26.685
HAYATE: You missed. You always were second best.

47
00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:41.625
HAYATE: Come home, brother. Not to the clan. To something better.

48
00:08:59.990 --> 00:09:03.540
HARUTO: So you're the brother. He would not shut up about you.

49
00:09:08.300 --> 00:09:12.500
RAIJIN: The guy who shot him off a waterfall? And we're just fine with that?

50
00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:14.150
MIREI: Raijin.

51
00:09:15.890 --> 00:09:20.265
YUZU: Another archer. Good. You got your brother back. Don't lose him again.

52
00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:26.530
SEIRAN: I have a debt to pay. Let me pay it with you.

53
00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:35.335
Two koi climbed the Dragon Gate. Two dragons came home.

54
00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:41.725
HAYATE: So, when I'm leader...

55
00:09:42.075 --> 00:09:43.225
SEIRAN: No.

56
00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:57.240
VORN: Then the Koryu will drown together.

